        "is_free": true,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cycling Arcade Race Simulator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your course. Customize it. Ride it immediately.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cycling Arcade Race Simulator combines indoor cycling with a runtime course creation system. Instead of only riding predefined routes, you can create and modify your own cycling environment directly inside the application and test it immediately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>Direct Road Edit</strong>, roads are created and edited directly in the 3D world. T-junctions, X-junctions, branches, closed loops and connected road networks allow you to design more varied courses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the road is finished, the system adapts the terrain and adds vegetation, SideObjects and other environmental details.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using <strong>Road Check</strong>, the finished course can be refined further. EasyRoads SideObjects can be inspected and adjusted at individual markers. Patches, buildings, props, traffic signs, road decals and markings can also be placed, moved and rotated manually.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thumbnail previews make it easier to see what you are about to place before adding it to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the course is ready, switch directly into <strong>Ride Mode</strong> and ride it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runtime Course Creator</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Direct Road Edit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >T and X junctions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branches and alternative routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Closed-loop courses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic terrain adaptation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic vegetation clearing around roads</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EasyRoads3D SideObjects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Road Check for post-build course editing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manual placement of patches, props and buildings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manual traffic-sign placement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Road decals, lines and road markings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thumbnail previews for placeable assets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save and load custom tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI/bot riders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sprint and KOM sections</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic fallback KOM placement on mountainous courses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elevation profile</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rider-relative wind display</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power-based cyclist animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple environments including Island, Hills, Country, Mountain and Cities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compatible smart trainer and fitness-device support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BLE / FTMS</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heart-rate sensor support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free Ride and Race Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple graphics-quality presets for different PCs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cycling Arcade Race Simulator is designed to make indoor cycling more than just a workout. It is also a small course-building sandbox where you can <strong>build, edit, ride and keep refining your own routes</strong>.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cycling Arcade Race Simulator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your course. Customize it. Ride it immediately.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cycling Arcade Race Simulator combines indoor cycling with a runtime course creation system. Instead of only riding predefined routes, you can create and modify your own cycling environment directly inside the application and test it immediately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>Direct Road Edit</strong>, roads are created and edited directly in the 3D world. T-junctions, X-junctions, branches, closed loops and connected road networks allow you to design more varied courses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the road is finished, the system adapts the terrain and adds vegetation, SideObjects and other environmental details.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using <strong>Road Check</strong>, the finished course can be refined further. EasyRoads SideObjects can be inspected and adjusted at individual markers. Patches, buildings, props, traffic signs, road decals and markings can also be placed, moved and rotated manually.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thumbnail previews make it easier to see what you are about to place before adding it to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the course is ready, switch directly into <strong>Ride Mode</strong> and ride it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runtime Course Creator</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Direct Road Edit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >T and X junctions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branches and alternative routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Closed-loop courses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic terrain adaptation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic vegetation clearing around roads</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EasyRoads3D SideObjects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Road Check for post-build course editing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manual placement of patches, props and buildings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manual traffic-sign placement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Road decals, lines and road markings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thumbnail previews for placeable assets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save and load custom tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI/bot riders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sprint and KOM sections</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic fallback KOM placement on mountainous courses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elevation profile</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rider-relative wind display</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power-based cyclist animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple environments including Island, Hills, Country, Mountain and Cities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compatible smart trainer and fitness-device support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BLE / FTMS</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heart-rate sensor support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free Ride and Race Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple graphics-quality presets for different PCs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cycling Arcade Race Simulator is designed to make indoor cycling more than just a workout. It is also a small course-building sandbox where you can <strong>build, edit, ride and keep refining your own routes</strong>.</p>",
        "short_description": "Cycling Arcade Race Simulator is a free indoor cycling simulation with a runtime course creator. Build roads, junctions and scenery, adjust SideObjects and props directly, then ride your course immediately with smart trainer support, bots, KOMs and sprints.",
